{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55369","headline":"华严六相义颂 · 文益","name":"华严六相义颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华严六相义，同中还有异。\n异若异於同，全非诸佛意。\n诸佛意总别，何曾有同异。\n男子身中入定时，女子身中不留意。\n不留意，绝名字，万象明明无理事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}